term Inp {
  id: "@community/term-inp"
  version: "1.0.0"

  meaning: "Interaction to Next Paint — a Core Web Vitals metric measuring the latency between a user input (click, tap, key press) and the next frame painted by the browser. INP replaced FID (First Input Delay) as an official Core Web Vital in March 2024 because it captures responsiveness across the entire session, not just the first interaction."

  domain: performance

  _meta: {
    license: "Apache-2.0"
    license-provenance: "package-authorship-claim"
  }


  aliases: ["Interaction to Next Paint", "responsiveness metric"]

  notes: [
    "Threshold (75th percentile of all interactions): Good ≤ 200ms; Needs Improvement 200-500ms; Poor > 500ms.",
    "INP is computed at the 98th percentile of a single user's interactions (with a minimum sample) — the worst handful of interactions in a session, not the average. Long tail dominates.",
    "Replaces FID (First Input Delay), which only measured the first interaction. Real user experience is governed by ALL interactions; FID was systematically optimistic.",
    "Components of INP latency: input delay (event waiting in queue) + processing time (handler + layout + paint) + presentation delay (waiting for next frame). All count.",
    "Common causes of poor INP: long-running JavaScript handlers (>50ms), forced synchronous layout (`offsetHeight` after a style change), large React state updates triggering full re-renders.",
    "Fixes: yield to main thread (`scheduler.yield()`, `await new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 0))`); use `useTransition` / `startTransition` in React 18 to mark non-urgent updates; debounce expensive recalculation.",
    "Measurement: web-vitals.js (`onINP` API) reports INP per page; Chrome User Experience Report (CrUX) aggregates publicly. See @community/tool-web-vitals-js.",
    "Long tasks (> 50ms blocks on main thread) correlate strongly with INP regressions. Lighthouse's TBT (Total Blocking Time) is a synthetic proxy.",
  ]

  related: [
    @community/fact-rail-targets,
    @community/metric-lcp-largest-contentful-paint,
    @community/metric-cls-cumulative-layout-shift,
    @community/principle-perceived-vs-actual,
    @community/tool-web-vitals-js,
    @community/collection-performance-budget,
  ]
}
